# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
#
# Several artifacts (skill/prompt assets, shell snippets) are consumed by Linux
# tools, and the SWE-bench evaluation containers are LF-only. Forcing LF avoids
# CRLF contamination across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must not be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
